Subject: [PATCH] Close the separately inlined private-directory Unicode route

BUILD-ONLY: depends on retained downloads/0001 and is NOT deployable with the
available ROM platform key. The exact Samsung android.media signer is required.
The retained patch only updates isFileInExternalAndroidDirs. Samsung inlines
QPR2 isFileInPrivateExternalAndroidDirs in checkDestinationFilePathRestrictions;
apply the same raw-or-NFD/default-ignorable-filtered predicate there, retaining
its existing canonicalization, IOException handler, permissions and rejection.

diff --git a/smali/com/android/providers/downloads/Helpers.smali b/smali/com/android/providers/downloads/Helpers.smali
--- a/smali/com/android/providers/downloads/Helpers.smali
+++ b/smali/com/android/providers/downloads/Helpers.smali
@@ -641,10 +641,31 @@
 
     invoke-virtual {p3, p6}, Ljava/util/regex/Pattern;->matcher(Ljava/lang/CharSequence;)Ljava/util/regex/Matcher;
 
+    move-result-object v0
+
+    invoke-virtual {v0}, Ljava/util/regex/Matcher;->matches()Z
+
+    move-result v0
+
+    if-nez v0, :qpr2_private_match
+
+    invoke-static {p6}, Lcom/android/providers/downloads/Helpers;->normalizeAndFilterDefaultIgnorableCodepoints(Ljava/lang/String;)Ljava/lang/String;
+
+    move-result-object p6
+
+    invoke-virtual {p3, p6}, Ljava/util/regex/Pattern;->matcher(Ljava/lang/CharSequence;)Ljava/util/regex/Matcher;
+
     move-result-object p3
 
     invoke-virtual {p3}, Ljava/util/regex/Matcher;->matches()Z
 
     move-result p3
+
+    goto :qpr2_private_checked
+
+    :qpr2_private_match
+    const/4 p3, 0x1
+
+    :qpr2_private_checked
     :try_end_2
     .catch Ljava/io/IOException; {:try_start_2 .. :try_end_2} :catch_2
